{
  "$comment": [
    "External artwork the shipped themes reference. Nothing here is committed:",
    "'pnpm media:fetch' downloads each entry into public/media/remote/, which git",
    "ignores. The manifest is versioned so any clone reproduces the same set with",
    "one command, and so a deployment can see at a glance what it is pulling in and",
    "from where.",
    "",
    "These files belong to Blizzard Entertainment. They are here because this",
    "install points at them; a deployment that publishes to the world should",
    "replace them with its own artwork by editing this file and src/config/site.ts."
  ],
